{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18933","headline":"湖州崔郎中曹长寄三癖诗自言癖在诗与琴酒其词逸而高吟咏不足昔柳吴兴亭臯陇首之句王融书之白团扇故爲四韵以谢之 · 刘禹锡","name":"湖州崔郎中曹长寄三癖诗自言癖在诗与琴酒其词逸而高吟咏不足昔柳吴兴亭臯陇首之句王融书之白团扇故爲四韵以谢之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"视事画屏中，自称三癖翁。\n管弦泛春渚，旌斾拂晴虹。\n酒对青山月，琴韵白苹风。\n会书团扇上，知君文字工。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18933.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18933","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}